4
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:11,490
What happened between you and Mr. Shen?

5
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:13,100
Can't just say forget it

6
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:14,300
three years ago

7
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,500
