17
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:38,390
Call me vicious

18
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:39,870
call me mean

19
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:41,470
I don't care about the money

20
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:44,110
I'm not sad when they humiliate me

21
